      "title": "Negative half-cent tips round away from zero",
      "detail": "Decimal's ROUND_HALF_UP rounds ties away from zero, so tip_cents(-1005, 10) gives -101. Another reasonable reading of 'half up' rounds toward +infinity and would give -100. No scenario covers negative totals or percentages, and the code does not reject them.",
